Hi,

try this:

ggplot(EPIDURALf, aes(Ease, OC, fill = Treatment)) +
  stat_summary(fun.y = mean, geom = "bar", position = "dodge") +
  facet_grid(Doctor~.) +
  coord_cartesian(ylim = c(0, 3))

