I'm not entirely sure what you're after regarding the appearance of
the x and y axis (scale-wise), but I did the following and it improved
the readability of the x-axis text...

ggplot(data = xx, aes(x = Animal, y = Value))+
geom_bar(stat = "identity")+
facet_grid(measurement ~ group, scales = "free_x", space ="free")+
opts(title = "Option Space Free", axis.text.x = theme_text(angle =
270, hjust=0, vjust=0.5))

